              <marker start="0/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 1" note="Everything on Solana starts with something you made." />
              <marker start="180/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 2" note="Get your project plan. Give your idea a direction." />
              <marker start="344/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 3" note="Experiment with tooling. Open up what you can build." />
              <marker start="511/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 4" note="With New Caloric, expand the capabilities of Solana. Go beyond token parameters." />
              <marker start="732/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 5" note="Hosting. APIs. Scripts. Local models. And more room to build." />
              <marker start="1022/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 6" note="Sell what you make. Turn your work into a product." />
              <marker start="1181/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 7" note="Grow your projects. And your community." />
              <marker start="1331/30s" duration="1/30s" value="Scene 8" note="New Caloric. Utilize Solana. For real." />
